# DsTextInput docs snippets

## Default

### Show code
<DsTextInput placeholder="Enter text..." />

### MCP manifest
const Default = () => <DsTextInput placeholder="Enter text..." />;

## Small

### Show code
<DsTextInput
  placeholder="Small input..."
  size="small"
/>

### MCP manifest
const Small = () => <DsTextInput size="small" placeholder="Small input..." />;

